13 — SEARCH & DISCOVERY

Search may return identity records only within visibility scope.

Identity result fields (public-safe):

MATCH
NAME / LABEL
CITADEL
STATUS
VERSION

Action:

VERIFY

not:

ASSUME

---

14 — ERROR & FAIL-CLOSED STATES

Identity not found:

UNKNOWN IDENTITY.

Verification unavailable:

EVIDENCE COULD NOT BE VERIFIED.
STATUS: UNVERIFIED

Revoked identity:

IDENTITY EXISTS HISTORICALLY.
STATUS: REVOKED

UI remains calm and factual.

---

15 — ACCESSIBILITY REQUIREMENTS

Identity flows must support:
- keyboard navigation
- screen reader labels
- semantic status output
- sufficient contrast
- reduced motion
- accessible QR alternatives

Meaning shall not depend on color only.

---

16 — SECURITY / TRUST UX

Always distinguish:

visual identity
vs
verified identity

and:

displayed status
vs
verified status

PALACO mark alone is never proof.

