20 — TESTABLE RULES

T-001 QR opens verification route.
T-002 Verification shows explicit outcome.
T-003 Revoked identity never appears active.
T-004 Hidden visibility data never leaks.
T-005 Physical card without live proof cannot pass as verified.
T-006 Authority is never inferred from visual prominence.
T-007 Provenance chain is inspectable from identity detail.

